<h2 class="big serif">Dear my friends. <span class="i">That's what De:maf means.</span></h2>{%- if s.sticker_patch != blank -%}<div class="stkb"><img src="{{ s.sticker_patch | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>{%- endif -%}
