<p class="to">Dear my friends,</p>
<p class="body"><span class="sent">De:maf is short for Dear My Friends.</span><span class="sent">Founder Regina Choi started it after her own acne.</span><span class="sent">A dermatologist told her to repair her barrier first.</span><span class="sent">Every formula still starts from that advice.</span></p>
<p class="sign">Glow my skin, glow my life.<small>Printed on every De:maf pouch</small></p>
</div>
<div class="facts"><div><b>1.2M</b><span>First Serum bottles sold</span><small>BizWatch, Apr 2026</small></div><div><b>#1</b><span>Olive Young skincare</span><small>As stated by De:maf</small></div><div><b>3</b><span>Steps, start to finish</span><small>Serum, ampoule, cream</small></div></div>
</div>
