<p class="wnote">Illustration based on De:maf's own texture notes, not a lab test.</p>
</div><div>
<div class="ben2" id="kd-ben2"><div><div class="n">1</div><div><h4>Moisture magnet</h4><p>Panthenol pulls water into the skin and holds it there.</p></div></div><div><div class="n">2</div><div><h4>Supports barrier recovery</h4><p>Ceramide NP and betaine help fill the gaps between skin cells.</p></div></div><div><div class="n">3</div><div><h4>Comforts sensitive skin</h4><p>Allantoin, madecassoside and centella calm visible irritation.</p></div></div><div><div class="n">4</div><div><h4>Soft and resilient</h4><p>Skin feels smoother and bounces back, with no sticky film.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="wsw" id="kd-wsw"><button type="button" data-v="30">30% · Rich syrup</button><button type="button" data-v="10">10% · Light, non-sticky</button><button class="re" id="kd-wre" type="button">Start over</button></div>
<p class="whint" id="kd-whint"></p>
