<div class="wrap"><section class="sec" id="kd-details">
<div class="kicker"><svg class="kstar" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#kd-star" fill="#E3001B"/></svg>Read the label</div>
<h2 class="big serif">Six ingredients. <span class="i">One calm barrier.</span></h2>
<p class="lead">The full list has ten actives. These six do most of the work.</p>
<div style="height:40px"></div>
<div class="lab3"><div class="lb star" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Hydration</span><i>30% · 10%</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="50" cy="56" r="30" fill="url(#kd-lav)" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M50 12c8 11 13 18 13 25a13 13 0 0 1-26 0c0-7 5-14 13-25z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M36 60a14 14 0 0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Panthenol</div><div class="what">Pro-vitamin B5. De:maf calls it a moisture magnet that supports barrier recovery.</div></div></div><div class="lb" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Barrier care</span><i>Mortar</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"><rect x="8" y="22" width="38" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect x="54" y="22" width="38" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect x="30" y="46" width="38" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect x="8" y="70" width="38" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect x="54" y="70" width="38" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff"/></g><path d="M8 43h84M8 67h84" stroke="#E3001B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Ceramide NP</div><div class="what">A skin-identical lipid that fills the gaps between skin cells, like mortar between bricks.</div></div></div><div class="lb" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Barrier care</span><i>Comfort</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 14c20 14 30 30 30 46a30 30 0 0 1-60 0c0-16 10-32 30-46z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M50 30v54M50 46l-12-8M50 60l14-10M50 72l-10-6" fill="none" stroke="#E3001B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Allantoin</div><div class="what">A long-trusted skin protectant that leaves rough, stressed skin feeling smoother.</div></div></div><div class="lb" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Barrier care</span><i>Water</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 88c-20 0-30-14-30-30 0-14 12-22 30-22s30 8 30 22c0 16-10 30-30 30z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M50 36c-4-10-2-18 6-24M50 36c6-8 14-10 22-8" fill="none" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M36 58h28M40 68h20" stroke="#E3001B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Betaine</div><div class="what">A humectant first found in sugar beets that helps skin hold on to water.</div></div></div><div class="lb" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Barrier care</span><i>Centella</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="#fff" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="34" cy="40" r="16"/><circle cx="66" cy="40" r="16"/><circle cx="50" cy="66" r="16"/></g><path d="M50 50v38" stroke="#E3001B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="4" fill="#E3001B"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Asiaticoside &amp; Madecassoside</div><div class="what">The soothing compounds of centella asiatica, for skin that turns red easily.</div></div></div><div class="lb" tabindex="0"><div class="hd"><span>Moisture &amp; soothing</span><i>Botanical</i></div><div class="vis"><span class="fo"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="#fff" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"><ellipse cx="50" cy="28" rx="11" ry="16"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="72" rx="11" ry="16"/><ellipse cx="28" cy="50" rx="16" ry="11"/><ellipse cx="72" cy="50" rx="16" ry="11"/></g><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="9" fill="#E3001B" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg></div><div class="tx"><div class="nm">Evening Primrose</div><div class="what">Oenothera biennis flower extract, listed by De:maf for moisture and comfort.</div></div></div></div>
<p class="alsob"><b>Also inside:</b> centella asiatica extract, rosemary leaf extract, sodium acetylated hyaluronate and hydrolyzed hyaluronic acid. <b>Rice starch</b> keeps the texture smooth instead of sticky.</p>
</section></div>
